Atlas overlay patch 0003: privacy/services-default-off
Why: no background traffic to the inherited project's web services unless the person turns them
on in settings: the services switch itself, search keyword shortcuts (bangs), the extension
download proxy, spellcheck dictionary downloads, browser update checks (WolOS updates the browser
through its package manager) and filter-list downloads for the bundled content blocker are all
registered off. The services origin, the onboarding flag and the consent flag are untouched, so
the settings page still shows every switch and works as before when the person opts in.
Effects to know: the content blocker runs on the lists bundled in the package until the person
enables list downloads; spellcheck has no dictionaries until enabled (patches-0 P-03).
Files: chrome/browser/ui/browser_ui_prefs.cc
Test filter: zero-egress test (AT-7); atlas://settings services page shows every switch off
Rebase risk: M (six inherited patches edit this block)
Release: 0.13
License: GPL-3.0-or-later (hunk in a file the inherited series patches)
